[I] Lib audio decoder

[T] libaudec is a small wrapper library over minimp3, libsndfile and
[T] libsamplerate for reading and resampling audio files. It supports all
[T] formats handled by libsndfile plus MP3 and is meant to be linked
[T] statically into larger projects such as Zrythm.

[U] https://sr.ht/~alextee/libaudec

[A] Libaudec Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

